# License

## Our own material — CC BY 4.0

Applies to `cases/**/prompt.txt`, `cases/**/README.md`, `cases/**/case.json`, `catalog.json`, and the text of this repository's `README.md`.

You may use, share and adapt this material **including commercially**, provided you credit this atlas and indicate whether changes were made. Suggested attribution:

> Prompt from [Seedance 2.5 Prompt Atlas](https://callirra.com/seedance-prompt-library) — CC BY 4.0

**Clips you generate from these prompts are yours.** Attribution is appreciated but not required for generated output; the licence covers the prompt text, not what the model renders from it.

## The community half — theirs, not ours

`community/**` is **excluded from the CC BY 4.0 grant above.** Those prompts and clips belong to the
authors credited in each case's README and in [ATTRIBUTION.md](ATTRIBUTION.md), and are included here
under the licence named there — usually CC BY 4.0, granted by the publisher that collected them rather
than by the person who made the clip. If you reuse any of it, carry the credit with it.

Rights holder and want something removed? Open an issue and it comes down.

